INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the current environment of barren plains with strong winds and overcast skies, my immediate priority is to address my increasing hunger and thirst, as well as to find some form of shelter to protect myself from the elements. My overall health is relatively stable, though I am slightly injured and ill, which could worsen if I don't find suitable shelter soon. I notice there are a few scattered rocks that might offer minimal cover. I will attempt to use these rocks to create a makeshift shelter, hoping it will provide some degree of protection from the wind and cold. Additionally, while the vegetation is sparse, I will search for any signs of edible plants or insects that might help alleviate my hunger. Recognizing the lack of visible water sources, I need to conserve my energy while staying alert for any signs of moisture in the area, such as damp soil or plant life that might indicate underground water. This strategy will involve careful exploration of my surroundings, prioritizing shelter and sustenance, while mindful of my physical limitations and potential dangers from exposure."
}

