INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "The environment is harsh with strong winds, low temperatures, and minimal resources. My overall health is not at its best, and I am experiencing hunger and some thirst. Given the high danger level due to exposure and lack of resources, my priority should be to find some form of shelter to protect myself from the elements and conserve energy. I will use the scattered rocks to try and construct an improvised shelter which offers some cover from the wind. This might help in maintaining my body temperature and reduce exposure. I also need to consider finding a water source, as thirst is a primary concern. However, immediate shelter is crucial to avoid further health deterioration. I will use my physical strength to arrange the rocks as sturdily as possible. I will note this learning in my diary as constructing a basic shelter using available materials."
}

