INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the hostile environment and my current status, my primary focus is on survival. The conditions pose a severe risk with low temperatures and strong winds contributing to exposure and potential hypothermia. My health is compromised, with a high hunger level and moderate thirst alongside low energy and illness. Since food and water are scarce, my approach would be to first seek hydration, given my thirst level of 6. I have observed insect activity which might indicate underground moisture, so I will attempt to dig in areas where insects are present, hoping to find some moisture. For shelter, I will explore the improvised rock shelter to see if it can be enhanced for better protection against the wind and cold. I need to conserve my energy as much as possible due to the low energy score, which means pacing myself and prioritizing warmth and hydration above all else. My current body temperature is still normal, but the exposure risk should be minimized swiftly. My immediate action is to find water and improve shelter, as these are crucial to improving my chances of survival in this barren landscape."
}

