INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the current situation, my primary focus should be on finding adequate protection from the severe weather conditions and searching for a more reliable water source, as dehydration and exposure to the cold are pressing concerns. The rocky outcrops previously identified offer minimal shelter, but I need to further enhance them for better protection against the strong winds and snow flurries. To do this, I will attempt to use any additional materials available, such as rocks or dry grass, to fortify the structure. Simultaneously, I should explore areas indicated by insect activity and bird sightings, as these are potential indicators of nearby water sources. My energy level is low, so I need to conserve energy and avoid unnecessary exertion. It's crucial to balance the immediate need for hydration and warmth with the risk of exhaustion, especially given my current health status. My past experience has taught me the value of observing wildlife behavior for survival cues, so I will prioritize this strategy while remaining cautious of the environmental dangers."
}

