INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "environment_status": {
    "terrain": "Barren plains with rocky outcrops",
    "temperature": -8,
    "weather": "Heavy snow with strong winds",
    "food_availability": "Minimal, sparse dry grass and few insects",
    "water_availability": "Potential underground sources but challenging to access",
    "shelter_options": "Improved rocky outcrops with additional fortification from gathered materials",
    "wildlife": "Increased activity of birds and insects near potential water",
    "danger_level": "Very high (severe exposure risk due to cold and worsening weather conditions)"
  },
  "prompt": "You are on barren plains with rocky outcrops. The temperature has dropped further, and heavy snow is falling with strong winds making it even more challenging to survive. The shelter has been somewhat fortified, but the cold is biting. You notice increased bird activity suggesting nearby water, but accessing it might be difficult. What do you want to do next?"
}

